7ac37905492eb1b2,2026-11-16T13:51:31+00:00,meeting,upcoming,Washoe County,Legistar,Washoe County,,Board of County Commissioners,2026-11-17,Attachment: BCC 11-17-26 - Attachment B - Outdoor Festival Business License Conditions of Approval,https://washoe-nv.legistar1.com/washoe-nv/attachments/f3ba9a72-e8fe-4560-9a47-0dc53101f146.pdf,https://washoe-nv.legistar1.com/washoe-nv/attachments/f3ba9a72-e8fe-4560-9a47-0dc53101f146.pdf#page=2,2,false,0,parking,10,Transportation,outside,Agenda item,Agenda item,"j. The applicant shall have signage along Isidor Court warning roadways users of the OHVs in the industrial area. k. As the applicant has 321 parking spaces, the maximum number of attendees shall be…",2,true,"j. The applicant shall have signage along Isidor Court warning roadways users of the OHVs in the industrial area. k. As the applicant has 321 parking spaces, the maximum number of attendees shall be limited to 642. 2. Washoe County Engineering and Capital Projects Staff contact: Mitch Fink, P.E., (775) 3...",2,false,"[{""type"": ""Agenda item"", ""title"": ""j. The applicant shall have signage along Isidor Court warning roadways users of the OHVs in the industrial area. k. As the applicant has 321 parking spaces, the maximum number of attendees shall be…"", ""pages"": [2], ""count"": 6, ""in_title"": true}, {""type"": ""Agenda item"", ""title"": ""2. Washoe County Engineering and Capital Projects Staff contact: Mitch Fink, P.E., (775) 328-2050 mfink@washoecounty.gov a. Provide alternative off-street parking area(s) to relieve parking…"", ""pages"": [2], ""count"": 4, ""in_title"": true}]","[{""term"": ""parking"", ""page"": 2, ""text"": ""j. The applicant shall have signage along Isidor Court warning roadways users of the OHVs in the industrial area. k. As the applicant has 321 parking spaces, the maximum number of attendees shall be limited to 642. 2. Washoe County Engineering and Capital Projects Staff contact: Mitch Fink, P.E., (775) 3...""}, {""term"": ""parking"