128a4e6d60a0d6b3,2026-11-16T13:51:31+00:00,meeting,upcoming,Washoe County,Legistar,Washoe County,,Board of County Commissioners,2026-11-17,Attachment: 2026-10-13 W,https://washoe-nv.legistar1.com/washoe-nv/attachments/6fdcdca6-0338-4570-8887-2a078f7e3ec6.pdf,https://washoe-nv.legistar1.com/washoe-nv/attachments/6fdcdca6-0338-4570-8887-2a078f7e3ec6.pdf#page=11,11,false,1,housing; accessory dwelling unit; ADU; sidewalk; parking; stormwater; water quality,22,Long Range; Transportation; Science and Data,agenda,Agenda item,Agenda item,26-0681 8C1 Recommendation to the Board of County Commissioners to approve an interlocal agreement between Washoe County and Nevada Tahoe Conservation District to utilize Washoe County allocated…,11,true,"...d of County Commissioners to approve an interlocal agreement between Washoe County and Nevada Tahoe Conservation District to utilize Washoe County allocated Tahoe Regional Planning Agency Mitigation Funds to provide financial support for the planning, project management, permitting, and design of the Burnt Cedar Water Quality Improvement Pro...",11,false,"[{""type"": ""Agenda item"", ""title"": ""26-0681 8C1 Recommendation to the Board of County Commissioners to approve an interlocal agreement between Washoe County and Nevada Tahoe Conservation District to utilize Washoe County allocated…"", ""pages"": [11], ""count"": 1, ""in_title"": true}]","[{""term"": ""TRPA"", ""page"": 11, ""text"": ""...d of County Commissioners to approve an interlocal agreement between Washoe County and Nevada Tahoe Conservation District to utilize Washoe County allocated Tahoe Regional Planning Agency Mitigation Funds to provide financial support for the planning, project management, permitting, and design of the Burnt Cedar Water Quality Improvement Pro...""}, {""term"": ""housing"", ""page"": 13, ""text"": ""...ove resolution R26-91 supporting the transfer of 771 Southwood Boulevard in Incline Village, Nevada from the Tahoe Transportation District (TTD) to 